  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons olive oil, divided",
    "1 large yam, peeled and cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "1 large parsnip, peeled and cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "1 cup baby carrots",
    "1 zucchini, cut into 1 inch slices",
    "1 bunch fresh asparagus, trimmed and cut into 1 inch pieces",
    "0.5 cup roasted red peppers, cut into 1-inch pieces",
    "0.25 cup chopped fresh basil",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "0.5 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Grease two baking sheets with 1/2 tablespoon olive oil each.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w0mlF5BZB-uLZh4SpP6H4xJjT-U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/165649roasted-vegetable-medley-DDMFS-002-step1-4bec4110b3cd4d56ac4f38fc7961f6c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/165649/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place yam, parsnip, and carrots onto the baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y9gpix3l-OElhGov7jrD8Rr_HWs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/165649roasted-vegetable-medley-DDMFS-004-step3-4960360276f146bd862f2e3cb39df90c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/165649/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 30 minutes, then add zucchini and asparagus, and drizzle with remaining 1 tablespoon olive oil. Continue baking until all the vegetables are tender, about 30 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iYNCmSD7k0HDMEqg0lHWKX3ECjY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/165649roasted-vegetable-medley-DDMFS-006-step5-d2e8570f598d4f808e51bb6f782889f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/165649/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once tender, remove from the oven, and allow to cool for 30 minutes on the baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bw1GbWeG-7lTZr5PfnyA3f-jcww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/165649roasted-vegetable-medley-DDMFS-007-step6-f2334084921f46d58912cd99dcd9c229.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/165649/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss roasted peppers together with basil, garlic, salt, and pepper in a large bowl until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3c2Y_AL61VshnYVWY0jU5wjSm0c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/165649roasted-vegetable-medley-DDMFS-009-step8-9f4f0d63347f4ef7877f53dc77f4f762.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/165649/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the roasted vegetables, and toss to mix. Serve at room temperature or cold.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
